TRAINED WEIGHTS
================================================================================

The router head (`data/router_head.npz`) is original work of this project: a
linear utility head fit offline against this project's own model x question
evidence matrix. It is distributed under Apache-2.0 with the rest of this
repository. See `docs/HEAD_FORMAT.md` for its contract.
